{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/pulls/36","id":4817877607,"node_id":"PR_kwDOTXmUNs8AAAABHyr6Zw","html_url":"https://github.com/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/pull/36","diff_url":"https://github.com/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/pull/36.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/pull/36.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/issues/36","number":36,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Refactor server composition and planning write authority","user":{"login":"zhouwen-giser","id":190796747,"node_id":"U_kgDOC19Tyw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190796747?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser","html_url":"https://github.com/zhouwen-giser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Server assembly previously mixed broad service/repository objects with UGV policy, and candidate planning could retain formal persistence responsibilities. This refactor composes fifteen typed server stages, isolates UGV/SMPP policy across application and server, and separates immutable User Goal/Workflow generators from formal plan submission. Existing facades preserve initial, interactive, experience, revision, Goal Patch, replan and child paths; initial Task evidence/automatic confirmation follows formal commit, with Capability binding before Task publication.\n\nPublic protocols, schemas, error codes, defaults, Task semantics, LangGraph runtime ownership and PostgreSQL authority remain compatible. No migration or runtime dependency is added. Partial startup cleanup, immutable candidates, CAS/idempotence, exact authorization and eight architecture negative fixtures have regression coverage. PR36 review fixes reload authoritative durable readiness on idempotent/confirmed-definition reads and atomically commit deferred attempts/root, readiness, source CAS, final plan/targets and fenced command effects. Four real PostgreSQL scenarios verify rollback with identical-candidate retry, persisted blockers, stale CAS cleanup and formal failed-plan persistence.\n\nValidation on runtime commit `6b3fc0e2bda523b8dcd0aa9934ef41f3e1af3766`, runtime SHA-256 `57f82abc90d87bda99fd285f06b9cc5b464cdeee38281c56b32d23b4502c161c`:\n\n- Final `pnpm verify:isolated -- --frozen` PASS: all 30 stages, 2652 unit / 552 contract / 271 integration / 77 E2E, fresh lockfile install and owned cleanup exit 0, unchanged runtime/baseline.\n- Original complete M1/M2/M3 gates remain tied to their individual source manifests. Same byte-identical frozen runtime/baseline passes eight restricted-role GOWM steps, two formal navigation/recon E2E and 30 native scenarios, including the four new PostgreSQL regressions.\n- Dependencies, migrations, wire/schema/protocol pins, original SRS/requirement baseline and prior traceability prefix are unchanged. The existing `http_json` MUST TCK scope passes 74 tests; original skips/deselections remain explicitly recorded.\n- The unchanged performance case passes all original sample counts and 15% drift / 10% Runtime P95 / 20 ms append limits with separately owned tmpfs PostgreSQL. Persistent-store migration, functional, integration, recovery and smoke gates remain intact. Existing lease fixtures now observe/control actual PostgreSQL transitions; production timing and original state/no-replay/order assertions are preserved. All thirteen failed full attempts remain failures with raw evidence retained.\n\n[Full acceptance](https://github.com/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/blob/09ae8fc8bc2496e0cc8ace4ee1b26f1015e99d01/reports/server-composition-planning-boundaries/20261011-local/FINAL_CLOSEOUT.md), [case-to-test evidence](https://github.com/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/blob/09ae8fc8bc2496e0cc8ace4ee1b26f1015e99d01/reports/server-composition-planning-boundaries/20261011-local/CASE_RESULTS.json), [frozen source identity](https://github.com/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/blob/09ae8fc8bc2496e0cc8ace4ee1b26f1015e99d01/reports/server-composition-planning-boundaries/20261011-local/M4_SOURCE_IDENTITY.json), [GOWM input equivalence](https://github.com/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/blob/09ae8fc8bc2496e0cc8ace4ee1b26f1015e99d01/reports/server-composition-planning-boundaries/20261011-local/GOWM_CURRENT_FROZEN_EQUIVALENCE.json), [failure history](https://github.com/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/blob/09ae8fc8bc2496e0cc8ace4ee1b26f1015e99d01/reports/server-composition-planning-boundaries/20261011-local/FAILED_ATTEMPTS.md). Final evidence head `09ae8fc8bc2496e0cc8ace4ee1b26f1015e99d01` has identical runtime inputs and unchanged original requirements. Code-version CI passes 148 planning and 103 adapter/registry tests; final evidence-head CI and normal merge are the remaining publication steps.\n\nModels/MCP are loopback fixtures; PostgreSQL/Redis and restricted roles are real. Site/provider operations and deployment are NOT_RUN. Existing project-level GOWM auxiliary-link gaps remain open; this PR certifies the approved refactor scope. Actual merge/CI records will be added in a status-only closeout after publication.\n","created_at":"2026-10-11T08:55:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-11T12:19:19Z","closed_at":"2026-10-11T12:19:19Z","merged_at":"2026-10-11T12:19:19Z","merge_commit_sha":"1607e0631dfe542b8604c6731c3cee57f936b3cc","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/pulls/36/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/pulls/36/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/issues/36/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/zhouwen-giser/skill-driven-agent-runtime/statuses/09ae8fc8bc2496e0cc8ace4ee1b26f1015e99d01","head":{"label":"zhouwen-giser:codex/server-composition-planning-boundaries","ref":"codex/server-composition-planning-boundaries","sha":"09ae8fc8bc2496e0cc8ace4ee1b26f1015e99d01","user":{"login":"zhouwen-giser","id":190796747,"node_id":"U_kgDOC19Tyw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/190796747?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser","html_url":"https://github.com/zhouwen-giser","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/zhouwen-giser/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id"